@startuml
' Conceptual view: storage identifiers and EF details intentionally omitted.
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
left to right direction
class Smurf {
  +Name : string {get; set;}
  +Age : int {get; set;}
}
class Village {
  +Name : string {get; set;}
}
class Pet {
  +Name : string {get; set;}
}
Village "0..1" --> "0..*" Smurf : Smurfs (intended membership)
Smurf "0..*" --> "0..1" Pet : Pet
note bottom of Village
  Source exposes a mutable Smurfs collection only.
  The intended 0..1 village per Smurf is not enforced:
  no reverse reference or exclusive-membership validation.
end note
note bottom of Smurf
  No age or name validation in source.
  Pet may be shared; no reverse collection on Pet.
end note
@enduml
